OL,3,GNEWSACalls grow for a new Catholic
OL,4,Asecondary school in Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalls are growing for a new Catholic
OL,7,Fsecondary school in Aberdeen, 50 years
OL,8,Fafter the last one closed.
OL,10,FThere are three Catholic primary
OL,11,Fschools in the Granite City, but
OL,12,Fparents and the Church say there should
OL,13,Fbe an option to choose a similar
OL,14,Feducation for older children.
OL,16,FThe number of Roman Catholics in
OL,17,FAberdeen has grown by more than 7,000
OL,18,Fover the last 20 years and they now
OL,19,Fmake up about 8.6% of the population.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
