OL,3,GNEWSACalls grow for a new Catholic
OL,4,Asecondary school in Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FAberdeen City Council's education
OL,7,Fconvener said they had limited funding
OL,8,Fand they had to prioritise investing in
OL,9,Fthe existing "deteriorating" school
OL,10,Festate.
